        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 75.0
      },
      "Description": "The name of the video capture device to use. The dropdown lists all devices detected on the system.",
      "Usage": "CustomDropdown"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "694ce2cc-cbdc-49d2-a591-6ac0d5fa16bd"/*ControlName*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1425.0
      },
      "Description": "The device control to drive, picked from everything the camera actually reports — the dropdown lists the same controls as the `ControlsCatalog` output. Send it with `ApplyControl`.",
      "Usage": "CustomDropdown"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "06c894a8-fe69-4cf6-bf54-b9c155b8f035"/*ControlValue*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1500.0
      },
      "Description": "Value in device units for the selected control (see `ControlsCatalog` for its range and current value). For menu controls this is the selected item's value — the dropdown lists the items as 'value — label'; for non-menu controls the typed value is used as-is.",
      "Usage": "CustomDropdown"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "145615c4-c65b-49e9-abb5-78338579e7a3"/*ControlAuto*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1575.0
      },
      "Description": "Strict two-way switch: true engages the selected control's auto mode (`ControlValue` is ignored); false, the default, applies `ControlValue` as a manual value — which disengages the auto mode on every platform. There is deliberately no 'leave auto untouched' option."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "723a1471-c002-44a5-9b9e-f325d716671f"/*ApplyControl*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1650.0
      },
      "Description": "Trigger that sends the ControlName/ControlValue/ControlAuto combination to the camera and self-clears. Control traffic runs on a background worker — `Status` reports the result (clamping, unsupported controls) one evaluation later."
    }
